					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					317b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				432a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				809d
			</span></i> ; v. supr. <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> V. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b> Arith.,
				<i>make up, amount to</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιαυτοὶ .
